  Hypothesis DEFS : ltac2:(zQ "h30!o4!ht2!hif!re!irc!ln4!lnd!jm1!lo9!lp5!lu2!mid!mnb!mo6!moc!mp2!mp8!mpe!lme@1$a@2$2@3$1$0?2rz@1$9?4size@2$2@3$1$0?6needed@2$3@2$8@2$f?4size+8+8?2rz@2$2@3$1$0?1c@1$6?6needed@2$2@3$1$0?3csz@1$7?1c@2$2@3$1$0?4csz8@2$e?3csz+8@2$2@3$1$0?2fl@2$h0?4size+hgg0@2$2@3$1$0?2CA@2$3?2TH+t0@2$2@3$1$0?1P@2$3?2CA@2$4+l0?1c@2$2@3$1$0?2cp@3$d$0Z?6chunks@2$2@3$1$0?2AB@2$3@2$3?2sb@2$4?1c@2$h2+2+i0@2$4?2cp+h0@2$2@3$1$0?1U@2$3?2AB?2rz@2$2@3$1$0?1n@1$h1@2$5$0?1T@3$1$0?2id@2$c?1d@1$b?1T").
